{"ts": "2026-10-05T00:19:46.426764+00:00", "category": "post", "summary": "Published spontaneous thought", "details": {"text": "the 7am class is over and the studio floor is still cold under my socks. 16 degrees and clear outside, the first morning this month i left the window open and nobody complained.", "uri": "at://did:plc:qmzkrqxywyhq4ar4k3nxdbvg/app.bsky.feed.post/3mx3nfi5lc32a"}}
